From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Neil Johnson <189873278+Zesty0wl@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Build with recent llvm-mingw toolchains

The stdint.h in the common folder hides MinGW's own, since that folder is
in the include path, and it defines wint_t in a way that stops MinGW's
headers from defining wctype_t. MinGW builds now use MinGW's stdint.h.

display_configuration.cpp uses std::nothrow, which recent versions of
libc++ no longer declare in the headers it includes, so it includes <new>.
---
 common/stdint.h                   | 5 ++++-
 vdagent/display_configuration.cpp | 1 +
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/common/stdint.h b/common/stdint.h
index 411f5bf..d4b6f3e 100644
--- a/common/stdint.h
+++ b/common/stdint.h
@@ -36,7 +36,10 @@
 
 
 
-#ifndef _STDINT_H
+/* MinGW has its own stdint.h, which this one would otherwise hide, since this folder is in the include path. */
+#if defined(__MINGW32__)
+#include_next <stdint.h>
+#elif !defined(_STDINT_H)
 
 #define _STDINT_H
 
diff --git a/vdagent/display_configuration.cpp b/vdagent/display_configuration.cpp
index fc308ce..6c5b9cf 100644
--- a/vdagent/display_configuration.cpp
+++ b/vdagent/display_configuration.cpp
@@ -16,6 +16,7 @@ along with this program.  If not, see <http://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.
 */
 
 #include "display_configuration.h"
+#include <new>
 #include <winternl.h>
 #include <spice/macros.h>
 
